Dialogue: 3,0:01:13.17,0:01:16.30,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,120)}我閃閃發光
Dialogue: 3,0:01:18.39,0:01:19.31,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}抬起頭看看吧
