Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.41,0:22:37.34,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.59,0:22:39.05,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}好想被愛
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.43,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.89,0:22:49.14,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.93,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.19,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.40,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.95,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.82,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.33,0:23:11.45,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.50,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.67,0:23:21.76,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}留在過去
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.30,0:23:28.10,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.43,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.56,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.56,0:23:39.52,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.65,0:23:43.65,ED - CN,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.70,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.62,0:23:57.37,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.41,0:22:37.34,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.59,0:22:39.05,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.43,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.89,0:22:49.14,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.93,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.19,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.40,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.95,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.82,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.33,0:23:11.45,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.50,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.67,0:23:21.76,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.30,0:23:28.10,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.43,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.56,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.56,0:23:39.52,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.65,0:23:43.65,ED - JP,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur0.6\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.70,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.62,0:23:57.37,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:37.34,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:39.05,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}好想被愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.43,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:49.14,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.93,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.90,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.19,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.40,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}沒有人同我心意相通
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.95,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.82,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.33,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:11.45,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.50,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:21.76,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}留在過去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:28.10,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.43,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.56,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs55}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:39.52,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs55}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:43.65,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs55}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.70,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:57.37,ED - CN - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:37.34,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:39.05,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}愛されたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.43,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.89,0:22:49.14,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:51.93,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.93,0:22:54.90,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.19,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.31,0:23:00.40,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)\blur5}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.95,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.82,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.33,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.33,0:23:11.45,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.45,0:23:15.50,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:21.76,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:28.10,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.10,0:23:30.43,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:33.56,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5\fs60}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:39.52,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5\fs60}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:43.65,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,3,,{\fad(500,500)\blur5\fs60}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:46.70,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.62,0:23:57.37,ED - JP - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)\blur5}きっと誰かの光だから
